  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1737079366_2601038_f7a9fbf92b3ee3bad436ccf6a190c56f.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">CausYou Jewelry </span></span><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">specializes in lab-grown diamond and moissanite jewelry, offering sustainable and ethical alternatives to traditional gemstones. The collection includes engagement rings, wedding bands, and fine jewelry.&nbsp;<br></span><br><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><strong>Product description:<br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CausYou's products feature high-quality, lab-grown diamonds and moissanite set in various styles of rings, earrings, pendants, and bracelets. These pieces are designed to offer durability and brilliance.</span><strong><br></strong>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;<br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CausYou's unique selling points include conflict-free gemstones, customizable jewelry options, and a strong focus on sustainability.&nbsp;</span><strong><br></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><strong>Payment terms:<br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Accepts American Express, Apple Pay, credit card, PayPal, and Visa.</span><strong><br></strong> </span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Other information:<br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">CausYou Jewelry </span></span>provides a one-year warranty, free engraving and resizing, and a comprehensive exchange and return policy. The jewelry is made to order, ensuring personalized attention to each piece.<br><br><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">For more details, visit: <a href=\"https://causyou.com/\">https://causyou.com/</a></span></strong></span><strong><br></strong></span></p>\r\n</div>",
